83
00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.560
Things to take note of.

84
00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:43.660
Define simultaneous-event order, update the

85
00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.220
queue at every event, and

86
00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.980
calculate metrics from the completed

87
00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.500
ledger. More I/O devices can

88
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.480
alter the execution order, so

89
00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.200
do not assume every scheduling

90
00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.240
